{
  "decision": "NO_CHANGE",
  "workflow_yaml": null,
  "rationale": "No supported change is needed. The workflow already caches pip dependencies via actions/setup-python with cache: 'pip' and cache-dependency-path: '**/pyproject.toml', which is the P-LIT-GHA-CACHE dependency-download cache; that pattern's own contraindication is 'An equivalent cache already exists'. Matrix fail-fast (P-LIT-FAIL-FAST) is enabled by default in GitHub Actions, so explicitly adding it changes nothing, and it is potentially contraindicated because all four Python-version results are needed to certify multi-version support. P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT lacks representative duration history (only three runs, one with unreliable timestamps) and would not shorten successful runs. Preserving build/test coverage, there is no safe, evidence-supported modification to make.",
  "evidence_ids": ["pattern:P-LIT-GHA-CACHE", "pattern:P-LIT-FAIL-FAST"]
}
